abstract: >-
  An autonomous metascience and forensic peer-review swarm for Google Antigravity
  and Python/R environments. It performs a non-compensatory 4-gate lexicographic
  triage (provenance & retraction screening, tortured phrases & paper-mill reagents,
  universal table & 95% confidence interval consistency, and clinical chart /
  genomics plot scrutiny) followed by Tier 2 Bayesian likelihood ratio credibility
  scoring.
